  "derivation": {
    "royal_energy": "Original closed/open painted source silhouettes retained. Original inner-lid texture is perspective-projected into the cavity floor to remove baked golden or flat yellow fill for an empty Open pose. Treasure adds rendered source coin geometry behind the original rim/latch occlusion; Magic uses the empty pose and sourced rays/stars without coins.",
    "crystal": "New authored magnetic opening, not an imported source animation. The actual 805x609 base image is split at its lower cyan cover seam; original source roof and upper corner ornaments lift together by220canvaspixels while lower shell/feet remain fixed. Newly exposed inner walls/floor/under-lid use perspective-warped brushed-silver pixels from that same acquired source image with dark teal material shading. All original nine prefab-part transforms and sort orders are retained in the closed assembly.",
